<title>GERMANY: German September car production unchanged.</title>
<headline>German September car production unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car and vehicle production showed no change in September from the same month a year earlier, the German Automobile Industry Association VDA said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Production</p>
<p>				  Sept 96	     Change vs Sept 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    377,200	     no change</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 17,800		+18 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    9,300		 -23 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    404,300	     no change</p>
<p>Exports</p>
<p>				  Sept 96		Change vs Sept 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    224,400	     +10 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 10,400		+23 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    4,600		 -32 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    239,400	     +9 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
